---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About MotorByte | Independent Automotive Stories"
  description="Learn about MotorByte, an independent automotive blog covering cars, motoring culture, and the stories behind life on the road."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">
    <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-orange-400">About</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">Cars have stories. We tell them.</h1>
    <div class="prose-post mt-8">
      <p>MotorByte is an independent automotive blog about the cars people drive, the culture around them, and the ideas shaping the road ahead.</p>
      <p>We publish articles, opinions, explainers, and automotive news for curious readers. Our goal is to make each story clear, useful, and enjoyable to read—whether it is about a familiar classic or a new direction for the industry.</p>
      <h2>How we work</h2>
      <p>We aim to distinguish reporting from opinion, check factual claims against reliable sources, and correct material errors when they are brought to our attention. Any sponsored content or material relationship will be clearly identified.</p>
      <p>MotorByte is a growing publication. We do not claim affiliation with vehicle manufacturers unless a story explicitly says so.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
